                "text": "Given $x_\\epsilon(t)=\\frac{2}{\\epsilon}\\mathbf{1}_{|t|<\\epsilon/4}$, which statement about $\\lim_{\\epsilon\\to0^+}x_\\epsilon(t)$ for fixed $t\\ne0$ and the integrated area is correct?",
